    "metaDescription": "Full-service dog and cat grooming in Memphis, TN — baths, haircuts, and premium treatments at UnSaid Memories. Book online.",
    "h1": "Dog & Cat Grooming in Memphis, TN",
    "copyParagraphs": [
      "UnSaid Memories isn't a chain location or a franchise outpost — we're a Memphis grooming salon, full stop. Our flagship at 699 Waring Rd is where every service we offer happens: baths from $45, bath and haircut from $75, premium treatments, add-ons, and the PAWfection Bath Club. If you live in Memphis, this is your neighborhood groomer — close enough to become a routine, good enough that you won't want to go anywhere else.",
      "Everything happens under one roof. Drop your dog off for a bath and haircut, and while they're on the table, shop our boutique for food, treats, toys, collars, and supplies — or order online and pick up at pickup time. One account covers your bookings, your orders, and your Bath Club membership. No driving across town between the groomer and the pet store; it's all here.",
      "Baths are the everyday workhorse — Labs after the Shelby Farms mud, doodles between full cuts, short-haired dogs who just need the nail-and-ear reset. Bath-and-haircut appointments are where our groomers shine: teddy bear cuts on doodles, clean puppy cuts on Shih Tzus, breed-standard work on Schnauzers and Poodles, and practical summer cuts when the Memphis humidity hits. Heavy shedders do well with our Deshed treatment (+$20/$30/$40 by size); itchy-skin dogs get real relief from the Oatmeal Soothe soak (+$12/$15/$18).",
      "Check-in starts with a hands-on assessment — coat, skin, nails, ears, temperament — and a confirmed price before anything starts. Appointments run about two hours for baths, two to three for cut appointments. You'll get a text at pickup plus a quick report on anything we noticed. Bring current rabies vaccination proof (vaccine given at least 24 hours before the visit); everything else is on us.",
      "Memphis has no shortage of grooming options. Ours keep coming back for three reasons: the price quoted is the price charged, the groomers remember their pets, and the shop means one trip does it all. Bath Club members ($129/$159/$199 per month by size, prepay 12 for the price of 10, 10% off additional pets) turn it into a standing routine with priority booking.",
      "UnSaid Memories — 699 Waring Rd, Memphis, TN 38122. Walk in to browse the boutique, book online for grooming, or start with a free consultation if you're new to professional grooming. Serving all of Memphis and Shelby County."
    ],
