      "The starts-at prices are real, not teasers. A $45 bath includes the shampoo matched to your pet's coat, fluff dry, brush-out, nail trim, ear cleaning, and finishing spritz — not a rinse and a towel. A $75 bath and haircut includes the full cut consultation. Add-ons are $10–$12 each, clearly priced. If a matted coat or XL size changes the number, we tell you at check-in and get your approval first. That's the whole pricing philosophy: no gotchas.",
      "If your pet needs grooming every month anyway, the PAWfection Bath Club is simple math: $129/$159/$199 per month by size, prepay 12 months and pay for 10, plus 10% off each additional pet in the same household. Regular grooming also prevents the matting and overgrown nails that turn into expensive fixes later. Prevention is cheaper than repair — in grooming like everything else.",
      "Book online in minutes — no phone tag. Pre-check-in from your phone. Drop off, run your errands, get a text at pickup. The boutique covers food, treats, and supplies in the same trip, and online ordering with local pickup means you can stock up without an extra drive. Current rabies vaccination proof required (vaccine given at least 24 hours before the appointment).",
