      "Packages bundle popular upgrades into one price, adding $20–$35 over the base bath or bath-and-haircut. Typical package combinations include premium shampoo, teeth brushing, nail grinding, a deodorizing treatment, and a finishing bandana or bow. Your exact package build and price are confirmed at booking.",
      "Pets sized XL receive a custom quote based on coat and condition — ask at booking or during your free consultation.",
