      "Every grooming service — bath, haircut, or package — includes a coat and skin assessment, shampoo matched to coat type, nail trim, ear cleaning, and a same-day report on anything we noticed. There is no separate \"basic\" tier where the essentials cost extra.",
      "Book a free consultation and a groomer will assess your pet's coat in person and quote the exact price for the service you want. For most pets, the starts-at prices above hold; heavy coats, matting, or XL sizes adjust from there — always with your approval first."
